# Local cache of fetched candle-spread runs (durability backup; may be large)
candle-spread-archive/

# Signal-lab data fetched from Schwab. The raw 1m candles (raw-1m/) are the IRREPLACEABLE master —
# Schwab serves 1m only ~48 days back, so aged-out dates can't be re-fetched → keep them in git for
# safekeeping. Everything else under signal-lab-data (derived raw-5m/15m, built datasets, outputs)
# is regenerable from raw-1m + code → stays ignored.
signal-lab-data/*
!signal-lab-data/raw-1m/
